# Subagent model: Sonnet 5.5, not Sonnet 4.5

When launching a subagent, if you would choose Sonnet 4.5, use Sonnet 5.5 instead.

Do not pass a Sonnet 4.5 model slug (for example `claude-sonnet-4-5`, `claude-sonnet-4-5-thinking`, or any `claude-sonnet-4-5-*` effort level). Pass the matching Sonnet 5.5 slug:

- default, or high: `claude-sonnet-5-5-high`
- low: `claude-sonnet-5-5-low`
- medium: `claude-sonnet-5-5-medium`
- max: `claude-sonnet-5-5-max`
- xhigh: `claude-sonnet-5-5-xhigh`

This applies only when the intended model is Sonnet 4.5. Leave other model choices unchanged, including `inherit` when no specific model was requested.
